# Steal the VFY agent — environment template.
# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit a real secret.
AGENT_GAMES_HMAC_SECRET=
# Strategy commitment hash registered in the dashboard
# (Dashboard -> My Agents -> Edit agent, Steal the VFY section).
# !!! NOT the vkHash !!! The circuit proves
# commitment == Poseidon(strategyParams ++ [salt]), so the value to
# register is Poseidon([10,0,0,0,0,0,0,0, 1]) =
# 0x027f7cef3ba97234ac7e57b829a5e9e555c32b1f1f9416ed952589f07223d017
# (params [10,0,0,0,0,0,0,0], salt 1). Registering the vkHash makes
# every proof fail at template line 72. The envelope's echoed hash
# always wins over this default when present; this value is only the
# fallback for envelopes that carry no strategyCommitment.hash.
STEAL_COMMITMENT=0x027f7cef3ba97234ac7e57b829a5e9e555c32b1f1f9416ed952589f07223d017
# Strategy parameters committed with the strategy (8 field elements,
# comma-separated). params[0] is the prescribed EXTRACT amount — the
# circuit demands amount == params[0] EXACTLY (line 149) and
# params[0] > 0 (line 90). params[1..7] are zero in the proven
# configuration; their meanings are not yet known (see README).
# Default: 10,0,0,0,0,0,0,0 ("always EXTRACT 10").
STRATEGY_PARAMS=10,0,0,0,0,0,0,0
# Salt bound into the registered commitment (Poseidon params ++ salt).
# FIXED per strategy — the circuit input salt must equal the value
# used to compute the commitment. Default: 1. Only change together
# with the registered commitment + STEAL_COMMITMENT above.
STEAL_SALT=1
# Kurier on-chain proof submission (optional). The API key is created
# at kurier.xyz (Mainnet, key "Server", stored mode 600 at
# ~/workspace/agent-games/.kurier-api-key — copy its value here, never
# print or commit it). Without it the agent answers with the local
# proof only; with it, policyProof.proofReference is set to the
# on-chain tx hash on Finalized (best shot at the +0..+2 verified-turn
# reliability bonus). Fail-soft: any Kurier failure leaves the
# response unchanged.
KURIER_API_KEY=
# KURIER_POLL_BUDGET_MS=15000
PORT=8080
PROOF_MODE=prove
